e,\r\n  Food and Nutrition, Hotel Management and Catering.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas1\" style=\"line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas1\" style=\"line-height:10.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\">GROUP B:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  <p class=\"nas\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n  line-height:10.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Integrated\r\n  Science, Health Science, Agricultural Science, Mathematics/Arithmetic\r\n  Process/Basic Mathematics, Economics, Physical and Health Education.</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"color:windowtext\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>",
